{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14224060","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14224060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422406001:1":{"text":"ここは部外者が立ち入る場所じゃない。出ていきなさい！","source_cn":"这里不欢迎外人。滚开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11840A8DBC37E5FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422406002:1":{"text":"ゴホンッ。サリエ様の名のもと、女王像の破片を調査するために来ました。","source_cn":"咳咳。奉沙利叶统领之名，我们来此执行公务，前来调查女王...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A968AFECA2DEAD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422406003:1":{"text":"サリエ？ふんっ、あの元総帥か、その権力は私にも及ぶのかね？","source_cn":"沙利叶？哼，他现在算什么统领，还有什么权力管我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A803716494267BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422406004:1":{"text":"これは権力の問題ではありません。破片に残る魔力が、サロクディアの人々を危険に陥れるかもしれないのです……どうか協力してください。","source_cn":"这不是权力的问题。雕像上残留的魔法极其危险，为了萨洛克...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163459D6571C653B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422406005:1":{"text":"ここに破片があるとでも言うのか！？まずはその証拠を見せてみろ！","source_cn":"我这里什么都没有！你们有什么证据吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC2FEE3A9AF0ED1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1422406005":{"text":"ここに破片があるとでも言うのか！？まずはその証拠を見せてみろ！","source_cn":"我这里什么都没有！你们有什么证据吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC2FEE3A9AF0ED1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422406006:1":{"text":"閣下、彼は偉大なるメイジです……これ以上、事を荒立てないでもらえますか？","source_cn":"阁下，我们有大魔法师在此感应……别让事情变得更麻烦，好吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEE8577494F05C46C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"閣下、彼は偉大なるメイジです……これ以上、事を荒立てないでもらえますか？","female":"閣下、彼は偉大なるメイジです……これ以上、事を荒立てないでもらえますか？","variant_male_record_index":"163945","variant_female_record_index":"163946","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422406007:1":{"text":"笑わせてくれる！事を荒立ててるのはどっちだ？衛兵！衛兵――","source_cn":"可笑！明明是你们来找我麻烦！卫兵！卫兵——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EDEFCA05CB52FF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422406008:1":{"text":"この侵入者たちを、今すぐ追い出すのだ！","source_cn":"把这些借公务之名的入侵者赶出去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10204FA58BCB2A3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"特別な魔力の波動を感じるんだ。","source_cn":"我感受到了特殊的魔力波动","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD22D7D1339224CBF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"特別な魔力の波動を感じるんだ。","female":"特別な魔力の波動を感じるのよ。","variant_male_recor